2
00:00:07,460 --> 00:00:08,200
Hey, Eddie.
嘿，艾迪。

3
00:00:08,580 --> 00:00:08,840
Ah!
啊!

4
00:00:10,780 --> 00:00:11,840
What are you doing here?
你在這裡做什麼？

5
00:00:12,080 --> 00:00:13,620
Nothing, Rumi, just watching you sleep.
沒什麼，魯米，只是看著你睡覺。

6
00:00:15,520 --> 00:00:16,040
Why?
為什麼？

7
00:00:16,560 --> 00:00:18,840
Makes me feel, um, peaceful.
讓我感覺，嗯，平靜。

8
00:00:19,340 --> 00:00:19,860
Please.
請。

9
00:00:20,920 --> 00:00:22,380
I can't sleep now.
我現在睡不著。

10
00:00:22,720 --> 00:00:23,720
You want me to sing?
你想讓我唱歌嗎？

11
00:00:26,060 --> 00:00:28,020
Look, that's it. It's over.
看，就是這樣。結束了。

12
00:00:28,020 --> 00:00:30,140
I want you out. I want you out of the apartment now.
我要你出去。我現在要你離開公寓。

13
00:00:30,180 --> 00:00:32,260
Whoa, whoa, whoa. What are you talking about, man?
哇，哇，哇。你在說什麼，老兄？

14
00:00:32,540 --> 00:00:33,220
Hannibal Lecter?
漢尼拔·萊克特？

15
00:00:35,560 --> 00:00:36,620
Better roommate than you.
比你更好的室友。

16
00:00:36,980 --> 00:00:37,160
No.
不。

17
00:00:37,940 --> 00:00:39,620
See, now I don't think you're being fair.
瞧，現在我認為你不公平。

18
00:00:39,740 --> 00:00:41,720
I mean, one night you see me and you get scared.
我的意思是，有一天晚上你看到我，你會感到害怕。

19
00:00:41,840 --> 00:00:44,060
I mean, what about all the other nights when you don't see me, huh?
我是說，其他那些你見不到我的夜晚又如何呢？

20
00:00:45,900 --> 00:00:47,960
What about last night when you went and got a drink of water
昨晚你去喝水的時候怎麼樣

21
00:00:47,960 --> 00:00:49,480
and I was nice enough to hide behind the door?
我還好心躲在門後？

22
00:00:49,520 --> 00:00:50,500
What's that about, huh?
那是關於什麼的啊？

23
00:00:51,980 --> 00:00:53,120
I didn't realize that.
我沒有意識到這一點。

24
00:00:53,440 --> 00:00:53,800
Yeah, yeah.
是啊是啊。

25
00:00:55,380 --> 00:00:56,320
Get out now!
趕緊出去吧！

26
00:00:56,320 --> 00:00:56,880
Okay.
好的。

27
00:00:57,480 --> 00:00:58,460
You really want me out?
你真的要我出去嗎？

28
00:00:59,700 --> 00:01:00,260
Yes, please.
是的，請。

29
00:01:00,380 --> 00:01:01,600
Okay, then I want to hear you say it.
好吧，那我想聽你說。

30
00:01:01,640 --> 00:01:03,400
I want to hear you say, you want me out.
我想聽你說，你想讓我出去。

31
00:01:03,760 --> 00:01:04,900
I want you out.
我要你出去。

32
00:01:05,060 --> 00:01:06,600
No, no, no. I want to hear it from your lips.
不，不，不。我想從你嘴裡聽到。

33
00:01:08,260 --> 00:01:09,500
Where did you hear it from before?
你之前從哪裡聽來的？

34
00:01:10,300 --> 00:01:11,400
All right, all right.
好吧，好吧。

35
00:01:11,500 --> 00:01:12,500
You know what, pally? I understand.
你知道嗎，夥計？我明白。

36
00:01:12,600 --> 00:01:13,640
Consider me gone. You know what I'll do?
就當我走了吧。你知道我會做什麼嗎？

37
00:01:13,760 --> 00:01:15,120
I'll go move into my brother's basement.
我要搬進哥哥的地下室。

38
00:01:15,200 --> 00:01:17,040
When he finds out, I'll go find someplace else.
等他知道了，我就去找別的地方。

39
00:01:18,500 --> 00:01:19,020
You know what?
你知道嗎？

40
00:01:19,160 --> 00:01:20,840
I'll be out by the time you get home from work tomorrow.
明天你下班回家時我就出去了。

41
00:01:20,840 --> 00:01:27,260
I heard that.
我聽到了。

42
00:01:51,480 --> 00:01:55,340
But I'll be there for you
但我會在你身邊

43
00:01:55,340 --> 00:01:57,780
When the rain starts to pour
當雨開始傾盆而下時

44
00:01:57,780 --> 00:02:00,800
I'll be there for you
我會在你身邊

45
00:02:00,800 --> 00:02:02,720
Like I've been there before
就像我以前去過那裡一樣

46
00:02:02,720 --> 00:02:05,800
I'll be there for you
我會在你身邊

47
00:02:05,800 --> 00:02:08,000
Cause you're there for me, too
因為你也在我身邊

48
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:16,720
Hey.
嘿。

49
00:02:17,240 --> 00:02:17,720
Hey.
嘿。

50
00:02:18,160 --> 00:02:18,440
Hey.
嘿。

51
00:02:18,440 --> 00:02:20,220
Well, look at you.
好吧，看看你。

52
00:02:20,660 --> 00:02:22,460
Finally got that time machine working, huh?
時光機終於開始運作了，是嗎？

53
00:02:24,060 --> 00:02:24,940
Seriously, you like it?
說真的，你喜歡嗎？

54
00:02:25,140 --> 00:02:26,840
This guy was selling them on 8th Avenue,
這傢伙在第八大道上賣它們

55
00:02:26,920 --> 00:02:27,900
and I looked at him, and I thought,
我看著他，我想，

56
00:02:28,080 --> 00:02:29,240
you know what I don't have?
你知道我沒有什麼嗎？

57
00:02:29,520 --> 00:02:29,980
A mirror?
鏡子？

58
00:02:32,200 --> 00:02:33,280
Fine. Make fun.
美好的。開玩笑吧。

59
00:02:33,540 --> 00:02:34,500
I think it's jaunty.
我覺得是瀟灑的

60
00:02:36,460 --> 00:02:38,540
Wow, for a guy who's recently lost his job,
哇，對於一個最近失業的人來說，

61
00:02:38,600 --> 00:02:39,760
you're in an awfully good mood.
你心情真好。

62
00:02:39,920 --> 00:02:40,740
Hey, I'll be all right.
嘿，我會沒事的。

63
00:02:41,340 --> 00:02:43,120
I mean, it's not like I'm starting from square one.
我的意思是，我並不是從頭開始。

64
00:02:43,500 --> 00:02:46,420
I was Dr. Drake Remore on Days of Our Lives.
我是《我們的日子》中的德雷克·雷莫爾博士。

65
00:02:46,420 --> 00:02:49,820
I mean, that's got to have some kind of cachet.
我的意思是，這必須有某種聲望。

66
00:02:51,440 --> 00:02:52,760
Cachet? Jaunty?
威望？活潑？

67
00:02:53,360 --> 00:02:55,140
Chandler gave me Word of the Day toilet paper.
錢德勒給了我每日一詞衛生紙。

68
00:02:57,580 --> 00:02:58,600
I'm gonna get some coffee.
我要去喝點咖啡。

69
00:03:02,580 --> 00:03:04,800
Go on. You know you want to.
繼續。你知道你想要。

70
00:03:11,860 --> 00:03:13,180
No, no, no.
不，不，不。

71
00:03:14,780 --> 00:03:15,260
Hey.
嘿。

72
00:03:15,260 --> 00:03:15,700
Hey.
嘿。

73
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:18,420
Oh, so, so, so, did you read the book?
噢，那麼，那麼，那麼，你讀過這本書嗎？

74
00:03:18,620 --> 00:03:19,300
Oh, my God.
我的天啊。

75
00:03:19,600 --> 00:03:20,640
It was incredible.
這太不可思議了。

76
00:03:21,040 --> 00:03:22,600
Didn't it, like, totally speak to you?
難道它沒有完全跟你說話嗎？

77
00:03:22,760 --> 00:03:24,300
Whoa, whoa, whoa. What book is this?
哇，哇，哇。這是什麼書？

78
00:03:24,760 --> 00:03:26,300
Rachel, you have to read this book.
雷切爾，你必須讀這本書。

79
00:03:26,500 --> 00:03:28,840
It's called Be Your Own Wind Keeper.
這就是所謂的「做你自己的風守護者」。

80
00:03:29,380 --> 00:03:31,600
It's about how women need to become more empowered.
這是關於女性需要如何獲得更多權力的問題。

81
00:03:31,980 --> 00:03:34,120
Yeah, and, oh, but there's wind.
是的，還有，哦，但是有風。

82
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:38,580
And the wind can make us goddesses.
風可以讓我們成為女神。

83
00:03:39,080 --> 00:03:40,400
But do you know who takes our wind?
但你知道誰帶走了我們的風嗎？

84
00:03:40,900 --> 00:03:42,020
Men. They just take it.
男人。他們只是接受它。

85
00:03:44,380 --> 00:03:46,280
Men just take our wind?
男人只是接受我們的風？

86
00:03:46,640 --> 00:03:47,920
Uh-huh. All the time.
嗯嗯。一直以來。

87
00:03:48,240 --> 00:03:50,140
Because they are the lightning bearers.
因為他們是閃電的攜帶者。

88
00:03:51,240 --> 00:03:51,760
Wow.
哇。

89
00:03:53,380 --> 00:03:55,060
Well, that sounds kind of cool.
嗯，聽起來很酷。

90
00:03:55,500 --> 00:03:56,460
It's kind of like The Hobbit.
有點像《哈比人》。

91
00:03:57,040 --> 00:03:58,920
It is nothing like The Hobbit.
它一點也不像《哈比人》。

92
00:04:00,160 --> 00:04:03,120
It's like reading about every relationship I've ever had.
這就像閱讀我曾經擁有過的每一段關係。

93
00:04:03,160 --> 00:04:04,000
Except for Richard.
除了理查德。

94
00:04:04,380 --> 00:04:06,580
Oh, yes, no. Richard would never steal your wind.
哦，是的，不。理查德永遠不會偷走你的風。

95
00:04:06,780 --> 00:04:07,260
No.
不。

96
00:04:07,660 --> 00:04:07,940
No.
不。

97
00:04:08,060 --> 00:04:08,820
Because he's yummy.
因為他很好吃。

98
00:04:09,140 --> 00:04:09,660
Yes.
是的。

99
00:04:10,700 --> 00:04:11,900
But all the other ones?
但其他的呢？

100
00:04:12,160 --> 00:04:12,680
Oh, yes.
哦是的。

101
00:04:12,820 --> 00:04:15,380
Oh, and the part about how they're always, like,
哦，還有關於他們總是這樣的部分，

102
00:04:15,420 --> 00:04:17,240
drinking from our pool of inner power.
從我們的內在力量中汲取力量。

103
00:04:17,400 --> 00:04:18,780
But, God forbid, we should take a sip.
但是，上帝保佑，我們應該喝一口。

104
00:04:19,720 --> 00:04:20,740
Anybody want a cruller?
有人要油條嗎？

105
00:04:21,080 --> 00:04:23,920
Okay, this is a typical lightning bearer thing.
好吧，這是一個典型的閃電承載者的事情。

106
00:04:24,700 --> 00:04:26,280
Right there. It's like, um,
就在那裡。這就像，嗯，

107
00:04:26,540 --> 00:04:30,140
hello, who wants one of my phallic-shaped man cakes?
你好，誰想要我的陰莖形狀的男人蛋糕之一？

108
00:04:37,580 --> 00:04:38,540
Who've you been dating?
你和誰約會過？

109
00:04:39,660 --> 00:04:46,600
I don't know.
我不知道。

110
00:04:46,600 --> 00:04:48,120
Don't worry about it already.
已經不用擔心了。

111
00:04:48,400 --> 00:04:49,400
Things happen.
事情發生了。

112
00:04:50,560 --> 00:04:52,620
So, you're not mad at me
所以，你沒有生我的氣

113
00:04:52,620 --> 00:04:54,080
for getting fired and everything?
因為被解僱等等？

114
00:04:54,700 --> 00:04:56,660
Joey, look at me.
喬伊，看著我。

115
00:04:57,520 --> 00:04:58,760
Look at me!
看著我！

116
00:05:00,380 --> 00:05:02,360
Do I have lipstick on my teeth?
我的牙齒上有口紅嗎？

117
00:05:06,660 --> 00:05:06,840
No.
不。

118
00:05:07,440 --> 00:05:08,660
Can we get back to me?
我們可以回到我身邊嗎？

119
00:05:08,660 --> 00:05:09,380
Look, honey,
看，親愛的，

120
00:05:09,580 --> 00:05:12,800
people get fired left and right in this business.
在這個行業，人們會被解僱。

121
00:05:13,260 --> 00:05:16,000
I already got you into audition for Another World.
我已經讓你參加《另一個世界》的試鏡了。

122
00:05:16,600 --> 00:05:17,380
All right.
好的。

123
00:05:18,720 --> 00:05:20,020
Cab driver number two?
計程車二號司機？

124
00:05:20,640 --> 00:05:21,600
You're welcome.
不客氣。

125
00:05:24,160 --> 00:05:26,140
But I was Dr. Drake Remore.
但我是德雷克·雷莫爾博士。

126
00:05:26,720 --> 00:05:30,220
How can I go from being a neurosurgeon to driving a cab?
我怎麼才能從神經外科醫生轉到計程車司機？

127
00:05:30,540 --> 00:05:32,580
Hey, there was a time
嘿嘿，曾經有一段時間

128
00:05:32,580 --> 00:05:35,620
when I used to play tickle-pickle with Rex Harrison.
當我和雷克斯·哈里森一起玩搔癢的時候。

129
00:05:38,100 --> 00:05:40,300
Things change. Roll with them.
事情發生了變化。和他們一起滾。

130
00:05:41,220 --> 00:05:42,920
But this is a two-line part.
但這是兩行部分。

131
00:05:43,660 --> 00:05:45,200
It's like taking a step backwards.
這就像倒退了一步。

132
00:05:45,820 --> 00:05:47,340
I'm not gonna do this.
我不會這樣做。

133
00:05:49,380 --> 00:05:49,940
Joey,
喬伊，

134
00:05:50,740 --> 00:05:54,280
I'm gonna tell you the same thing I told Al Minzer
我會告訴你我告訴阿爾明澤的同樣的事情

135
00:05:54,280 --> 00:05:55,720
and his pyramid of dogs.
和他的狗金字塔。

136
00:05:57,660 --> 00:05:59,500
Take any job you can get
接受任何你能找到的工作

137
00:05:59,500 --> 00:06:01,000
and don't make on the floor.
並且不要在地板上製作。

138
00:06:02,960 --> 00:06:03,800
I'm sorry.
對不起。

139
00:06:08,920 --> 00:06:09,720
Oh, God.
哦，上帝。

140
00:06:10,980 --> 00:06:13,260
Oh, God. I mean, it's just so...
哦，上帝。我的意思是，事情就是這樣...

141
00:06:13,260 --> 00:06:13,720
Isn't it?
不是嗎？

142
00:06:15,020 --> 00:06:17,400
I mean, this is like reading about my own life.
我的意思是，這就像閱讀我自己的生活。

143
00:06:18,020 --> 00:06:19,720
I mean, this book could have been called
我的意思是，這本書可以被稱為

144
00:06:19,720 --> 00:06:21,100
Be Your Own Wind Keeper, Rachel.
做你自己的風守護者，雷切爾。

145
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:24,420
I don't think it would have sold a million copies,
我不認為它會賣出一百萬本

146
00:06:24,520 --> 00:06:25,860
but it would have made a nice gift for you.
但它會是送給你的一份很好的禮物。

147
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:28,400
Hey, guys.
嘿，夥計們。

148
00:06:28,780 --> 00:06:29,140
Hey.
嘿。

149
00:06:29,780 --> 00:06:30,940
Uh, sweetie, we've gotta go.
呃，親愛的，我們得走了。

150
00:06:32,040 --> 00:06:32,440
No!
不！

151
00:06:35,040 --> 00:06:35,440
No?
不？

152
00:06:35,440 --> 00:06:36,020
No.
不。

153
00:06:36,140 --> 00:06:38,560
No, why do we always have to do everything
不，為什麼我們總是要做一切

154
00:06:38,560 --> 00:06:40,920
according to your timetable?
根據你的時間表？

155
00:06:41,420 --> 00:06:43,940
Actually, it's the movie theater that has the timetable.
其實是電影院有時間表。

156
00:06:45,260 --> 00:06:46,800
So you don't miss the beginning.
所以你不會錯過開頭。

157
00:06:48,680 --> 00:06:50,860
No, see, this isn't about the movie theater.
不，你看，這不是關於電影院的。

158
00:06:51,140 --> 00:06:53,780
This is about you stealing my wind.
這是關於你偷了我的風。

159
00:06:55,540 --> 00:06:56,620
You go, girl!
你走吧，姑娘！

160
00:07:00,120 --> 00:07:01,760
I can't pull that off, can I?
我無法做到這一點，可以嗎？

161
00:07:04,120 --> 00:07:05,640
Excuse me, your...
對不起，你的...

162
00:07:05,640 --> 00:07:07,140
Your wind?
你的風？

163
00:07:07,480 --> 00:07:08,600
Yes, my wind.
是的，我的風。

164
00:07:09,280 --> 00:07:12,020
How do you expect me to grow if you won't let me blow?
如果你不讓我吹氣，你還指望我該如何成長？

165
00:07:18,500 --> 00:07:22,200
You know I don't have a...
你知道我沒有...

166
00:07:23,580 --> 00:07:25,560
Have a problem with that.
有問題嗎？

167
00:07:33,760 --> 00:07:34,320
Okay.
好的。

168
00:07:36,740 --> 00:07:37,680
I just...
我只是...

169
00:07:37,680 --> 00:07:40,340
I just really need to be with myself right now.
我現在真的需要和自己在一起。

170
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:42,900
I'm sorry.
對不起。

171
00:07:43,180 --> 00:07:43,880
Mm-mm-mm-mm.
毫米-毫米-毫米-毫米。

172
00:07:44,200 --> 00:07:44,800
Are you all right?
你還好嗎？

173
00:07:45,700 --> 00:07:46,980
I don't have to apologize.
我不需要道歉。

174
00:07:47,980 --> 00:07:48,460
Sorry.
對不起。

175
00:07:49,040 --> 00:07:49,440
Damn it!
該死的！

176
00:07:56,060 --> 00:07:56,880
What in the...
什麼在...

177
00:07:56,880 --> 00:07:58,120
I don't know.
我不知道。

178
00:07:58,220 --> 00:08:00,800
It's got all this stuff about wind and trees,
它有關於風和樹的所有這些東西，

179
00:08:00,940 --> 00:08:03,080
and there's some kind of sacred pool in it.
裡面有某種神聖的池子。

180
00:08:03,160 --> 00:08:06,260
I mean, I don't really get it, but she's pretty upset about it.
我的意思是，我不太明白，但她對此感到非常沮喪。

181
00:08:06,320 --> 00:08:08,200
See, this is why I don't date women who read.
看，這就是為什麼我不和讀書的女人約會的原因。

182
00:08:11,080 --> 00:08:11,680
Uh-oh.
呃哦。

183
00:08:12,160 --> 00:08:13,460
What? What's that?
什麼？那是什麼？

184
00:08:14,320 --> 00:08:15,440
It's my visa bill.
這是我的簽證帳單。

185
00:08:16,120 --> 00:08:17,380
Envelope one of two.
兩個信封之一。

186
00:08:20,200 --> 00:08:21,280
That can't be good.
那可不太好。

187
00:08:21,360 --> 00:08:22,340
Open it. Open it.
開啟它。開啟它。

188
00:08:26,300 --> 00:08:27,560
Oh, my God.
我的天啊。

189
00:08:27,580 --> 00:08:27,820
Whoa.
哇哦。

190
00:08:28,520 --> 00:08:29,420
Look at this.
看看這個。

191
00:08:29,780 --> 00:08:31,040
How did I spend so much money?
我怎麼花了這麼多錢？

192
00:08:31,160 --> 00:08:33,760
Uh, Joey, that's just the minimum amount due.
呃，喬伊，這只是最低應付金額。

193
00:08:33,860 --> 00:08:34,820
That's your total due.
這就是你的應付款總額。

194
00:08:35,080 --> 00:08:35,480
Ah!
啊!

195
00:08:36,720 --> 00:08:36,920
What?
什麼？

196
00:08:37,340 --> 00:08:37,720
Whoa, whoa.
哇哦，哇哦。

197
00:08:37,840 --> 00:08:41,120
$3,500 at porcelain safari?
瓷器之旅 3,500 美元？

198
00:08:41,780 --> 00:08:42,580
My animals.
我的動物們。

199
00:08:44,140 --> 00:08:45,500
Hey, the guy said they suited me.
嘿，那傢伙說他們適合我。

200
00:08:45,640 --> 00:08:46,620
He spoke with an accent.
他說話帶有口音。

201
00:08:46,900 --> 00:08:47,880
I was all confused.
我整個人都糊塗了。

202
00:08:49,540 --> 00:08:50,860
I don't know what I'm gonna do.
我不知道我要做什麼。

203
00:08:50,980 --> 00:08:53,800
Well, I guess you can start by driving a cab on another world.
好吧，我想你可以從在另一個世界駕駛計程車開始。

204
00:08:54,420 --> 00:08:54,860
What?
什麼？

205
00:08:55,360 --> 00:08:55,980
That audition?
那個試鏡？

206
00:08:56,560 --> 00:08:57,840
That's a two-line part.
這是兩行部分。

207
00:08:58,460 --> 00:09:01,740
Joey, you owe $1,100 at I Love Lucite.
喬伊，你在 I Love Lucite 欠了 1,100 美元。

208
00:09:02,780 --> 00:09:03,520
So what?
所以呢？

209
00:09:04,020 --> 00:09:06,240
So suck it up, man. It's a job. It's money.
所以忍住吧，老兄。這是一份工作。這是錢。

210
00:09:06,280 --> 00:09:10,720
Hey, look, I don't need you getting all judgmental and condescending and pedantic.
嘿，聽著，我不需要你做出所有的評判、居高臨下和迂腐。

211
00:09:12,020 --> 00:09:12,660
Toilet paper?
衛生紙？

212
00:09:12,960 --> 00:09:13,240
Yeah.
是的。

213
00:09:15,900 --> 00:09:18,320
Look, I'm not being any of those things, okay?
聽著，我不會做那些事，好嗎？

214
00:09:18,380 --> 00:09:19,300
I'm just being realistic.
我只是很現實。

215
00:09:19,440 --> 00:09:20,260
Well, knock it off.
好吧，把它關掉吧。

216
00:09:20,380 --> 00:09:21,500
You're supposed to be my friend.
你應該是我的朋友。

217
00:09:21,580 --> 00:09:22,440
I am your friend.
我是你的朋友。

218
00:09:22,440 --> 00:09:27,760
Well, then tell me things like, Joey, you'll be fine and hang in there and something big's gonna come along.
好吧，然後告訴我，喬伊，你會沒事的，堅持下去，會有大事發生。

219
00:09:27,800 --> 00:09:28,280
I know it.
我知道這。

220
00:09:28,320 --> 00:09:29,580
But I don't know it.
但我不知道。

221
00:09:29,660 --> 00:09:33,300
What I do know is that you owe $2,300 at Isn't It Chromantic.
我所知道的是你在Isn't It Chromantic 欠了2,300 美元。

222
00:09:34,820 --> 00:09:36,700
Hey, Ross, I'm aware of what I owe.
嘿，羅斯，我知道我欠了什麼。

223
00:09:36,900 --> 00:09:38,320
Okay, well, then get some sense.
好吧，那就明白一點吧。

224
00:09:38,540 --> 00:09:40,800
I mean, it took you, what, ten years to get that job?
我的意思是，你花了十年才得到那份工作？

225
00:09:40,900 --> 00:09:42,620
Who knows how long it's gonna be till you get another.
誰知道要等多久才能得到另一個。

226
00:09:42,740 --> 00:09:44,120
Look, I don't wanna hear this right now.
聽著，我現在不想聽這個。

227
00:09:44,260 --> 00:09:45,200
I'm just saying.
我只是說說而已。

228
00:09:45,220 --> 00:09:46,900
Well, don't just say.
好吧，別只是說。

229
00:09:49,680 --> 00:09:51,260
You know, maybe I should just go.
你知道，也許我應該離開。

230
00:09:51,260 --> 00:09:51,780
Okay.
好的。

231
00:09:53,180 --> 00:09:53,780
Okay.
好的。

232
00:09:54,140 --> 00:09:54,900
I'll see you later.
稍後見。

233
00:09:56,960 --> 00:09:58,900
Just think about it, okay?
想想看，好嗎？

234
00:09:59,080 --> 00:10:00,440
I don't need to think about it.
我不需要考慮它。

235
00:10:01,100 --> 00:10:02,740
I was Dr. Drake Ramore.
我是德雷克·拉莫爾博士。

236
00:10:03,280 --> 00:10:04,520
That was huge.
那是巨大的。

237
00:10:05,620 --> 00:10:06,860
Big things are gonna happen.
大事即將發生。

238
00:10:06,960 --> 00:10:07,540
You'll see.
你會看到的。

239
00:10:08,400 --> 00:10:08,860
Ross.
羅斯.

240
00:10:09,920 --> 00:10:10,620
You still there?
你還在嗎？

241
00:10:34,060 --> 00:10:34,380
Hey.
嘿。

242
00:10:34,500 --> 00:10:34,600
Hey, pal.
嘿，朋友。

243
00:10:35,560 --> 00:10:39,800
Eddie, what are you still doing here?
艾迪，你還在這裡做什麼？

244
00:10:40,040 --> 00:10:42,980
Just some basic dehydrating of a few fruits and vegetables.
只是對一些水果和蔬菜進行一些基本的脫水。

245
00:10:43,260 --> 00:10:44,960
Man alive, this thing's fantastic.
人活著，這件事太棒了。

246
00:10:46,960 --> 00:10:48,500
Look, Eddie, aren't you forgetting anything?
聽著，艾迪，你是不是忘了什麼？

247
00:10:48,880 --> 00:10:49,600
Oh, yeah, that's right.
哦，是的，沒錯。

248
00:10:49,640 --> 00:10:50,840
Look, I got us a new goldfish.
看，我買了一條新金魚給我們。

249
00:10:51,300 --> 00:10:53,260
He's a lot feistier than the last one.
他比上一個強多了。

250
00:10:53,460 --> 00:10:55,660
Yeah, maybe because the last one was made by Pepperidge Farm.
是的，也許是因為最後一個是 Pepperidge Farm 製作的。

251
00:10:57,960 --> 00:11:01,700
Look, Eddie, isn't there something else you're supposed to be doing right now?
聽著，艾迪，你現在沒有別的事情要做嗎？

252
00:11:01,820 --> 00:11:04,620
Well, not unless it's got something to do with dehydrating, my man,
好吧，除非它與脫水有關，夥計，

253
00:11:04,660 --> 00:11:06,320
because right now I'm a dehydrating maniac!
因為現在我是一個脫水狂！

254
00:11:08,000 --> 00:11:11,280
Look, you have to help me out here.
聽著，你必須幫我出去。

255
00:11:11,320 --> 00:11:12,100
I thought we had a deal.
我以為我們達成了協議。

256
00:11:12,180 --> 00:11:13,020
I thought by the time I got...
我以為當我拿到...

257
00:11:13,020 --> 00:11:13,120
Uh-uh.
呃呃。

258
00:11:13,720 --> 00:11:14,340
You know what that is?
你知道那是什麼嗎？

259
00:11:15,560 --> 00:11:16,800
Your last roommate's kidney?
你上一個室友的腎臟？

260
00:11:18,200 --> 00:11:19,560
That's a tomato.
那是一個西紅柿。

261
00:11:20,840 --> 00:11:22,940
This one definitely goes on the display.
這肯定會出現在顯示器上。

262
00:11:29,100 --> 00:11:33,380
Hey, Gunther.
嘿，岡瑟。

263
00:11:33,840 --> 00:11:35,560
Can we get a lemonade to go?
我們可以去喝檸檬水嗎？

264
00:11:36,300 --> 00:11:36,700
Lemonade?
檸檬水？

265
00:11:37,620 --> 00:11:38,220
You okay, man?
你還好嗎，老兄？

266
00:11:39,960 --> 00:11:41,480
Ah, it's career stuff.
啊，這是職業生涯的事。

267
00:11:41,820 --> 00:11:44,420
I don't know if you heard, but they killed off my character on the show.
我不知道你是否聽說過，但他們在節目中殺死了我的角色。

268
00:11:44,840 --> 00:11:45,740
Oh, that's too bad.
哦，那太糟糕了。

269
00:11:46,220 --> 00:11:46,900
How'd they do it?
他們是怎麼做到的？

270
00:11:47,520 --> 00:11:49,080
I fell down an elevator shaft.
我從電梯井裡摔下來。

271
00:11:50,480 --> 00:11:51,480
That sucks.
太糟糕了。

272
00:11:51,780 --> 00:11:53,580
I was buried in an avalanche.
我被雪崩埋葬了。

273
00:11:55,300 --> 00:11:55,800
What?
什麼？

274
00:11:56,440 --> 00:11:58,160
I used to be Bryce on All My Children.
我曾經是《我所有的孩子》中的布萊斯。

275
00:12:20,940 --> 00:12:22,580
Why must everybody watch me sleep?
為什麼每個人都必須看著我睡覺？

276
00:12:23,300 --> 00:12:24,760
There'll be no more watching me sleep.
再也不會有人看著我睡了。

277
00:12:24,840 --> 00:12:25,340
No more!
不再！

278
00:12:25,920 --> 00:12:26,240
Watching!
看著！

279
00:12:26,540 --> 00:12:26,780
I won't!
我不會！

280
00:12:37,680 --> 00:12:38,700
Hey, man, check it out.
嘿，夥計，檢查一下。

281
00:12:38,760 --> 00:12:40,320
I got some great new stuff to dehydrate.
我得到了一些很棒的新東西來脫水。

282
00:12:40,420 --> 00:12:41,200
You know, I got some grapes.
你知道，我有一些葡萄。

283
00:12:41,540 --> 00:12:42,360
Got some apricots.
買了一些杏子。

284
00:12:42,460 --> 00:12:44,760
I thought it'd be really cool to see what happens with these water balloons.
我覺得看看這些水氣球會發生什麼事真是太酷了。

285
00:12:46,220 --> 00:12:46,580
Get out.
出去。

286
00:12:47,260 --> 00:12:49,060
Get out, get out, get out, get out, get out.
出去，出去，出去，出去，出去。

287
00:12:49,060 --> 00:12:49,440
Get out.
出去。

288
00:12:50,760 --> 00:12:51,160
What?
什麼？

289
00:12:51,420 --> 00:12:52,480
You, move out.
你，搬出去吧。

290
00:12:52,760 --> 00:12:56,300
Take your fruit, your stupid, small fruit, and get out!
帶上你的水果，你愚蠢的小水果，滾出去！

291
00:12:57,380 --> 00:12:58,720
You want me to move out?
你想讓我搬出去嗎？

292
00:13:02,820 --> 00:13:03,420
Uh-huh.
嗯嗯。

293
00:13:06,820 --> 00:13:09,680
I, uh, I gotta tell you, man, I mean, that's, uh,
我，呃，我必須告訴你，夥計，我的意思是，那是，呃，

294
00:13:10,220 --> 00:13:11,720
that's kinda out of the blue, I mean, don't you think?
我的意思是，這有點出乎意料，你不覺得嗎？

295
00:13:13,160 --> 00:13:14,500
This is not out of the blue!
這並非憑空而來！

296
00:13:15,100 --> 00:13:17,000
This is smack dab in the middle of the blue!
這正好位於藍色的中間！

297
00:13:17,360 --> 00:13:17,760
Oh!
哦！

298
00:13:20,040 --> 00:13:20,400
Relax!
放鬆！

299
00:13:20,640 --> 00:13:21,580
Take it easy, buddy.
放輕鬆，夥計。

300
00:13:22,020 --> 00:13:22,860
Don't tell me twice.
不要告訴我兩次。

301
00:13:22,920 --> 00:13:23,400
You want me to go?
你要我走嗎？

302
00:13:23,500 --> 00:13:24,500
All right, all right.
好吧，好吧。

303
00:13:24,920 --> 00:13:26,240
I just wanna be by for my stuff.
我只是想留下來拿我的東西。

304
00:13:32,060 --> 00:13:34,740
But if you think for one second I'm leaving you alone with my fish,
但如果你認為我會讓你獨自一人和我的魚在一起，

305
00:13:34,780 --> 00:13:35,760
you're insane, Jack!
你瘋了，傑克！

306
00:13:36,800 --> 00:13:37,940
You want some help, man?
你需要幫助嗎，夥計？

307
00:13:38,220 --> 00:13:39,500
No help required, Chico.
不需要幫助，奇科。

308
00:13:47,240 --> 00:13:48,760
You don't see that every day.
你不會每天都看到這樣的情況。

309
00:13:53,200 --> 00:13:54,760
All the way to the airport, huh?
一直到機場吧？

310
00:13:55,300 --> 00:13:56,820
You know, that's over 30 miles.
你知道，那已經超過30英里了。

311
00:13:57,120 --> 00:13:59,560
That's gonna cost you about so bucks.
這會花你大約這麼多錢。

312
00:14:00,420 --> 00:14:02,520
Excuse me, that's 50 bucks.
對不起，這是 50 美元。

313
00:14:03,660 --> 00:14:04,220
What?
什麼？

314
00:14:04,920 --> 00:14:06,680
Five-oh dollars.
五塊錢。

315
00:14:06,960 --> 00:14:08,860
Oh, you know what it is?
哦，你知道那是什麼嗎？

316
00:14:09,320 --> 00:14:11,460
It's smudgy, because they're fax pages.
很髒，因為它們是傳真頁。

317
00:14:12,120 --> 00:14:13,480
Now, when I was on Days of Our Lives,
現在，當我參加《我們的日子》時，

318
00:14:13,480 --> 00:14:14,800
as Dr. Drake Ramore,
德雷克·拉莫爾博士，

319
00:14:15,980 --> 00:14:18,760
they'd send over the whole script on real paper and everything.
他們會把完整的劇本和所有的東西寫在紙上寄過來。

320
00:14:19,060 --> 00:14:20,720
Yeah, that's great.
是的，那太好了。

321
00:14:21,620 --> 00:14:22,900
And just so you know,
只是想讓你知道，

322
00:14:23,200 --> 00:14:24,720
if you wanted to expand this scene,
如果你想擴充套件這個場景

323
00:14:24,840 --> 00:14:26,560
like have the cab crash or something,
例如計程車撞車什麼的

324
00:14:26,760 --> 00:14:28,100
I could attend to the victims,
我可以照顧受害者，

325
00:14:28,200 --> 00:14:29,780
because I have a background in medical acting.
因為我有醫學表演背景。

326
00:14:31,720 --> 00:14:33,440
Okay, listen, thanks for coming in.
好的，聽著，謝謝你的到來。

327
00:14:33,580 --> 00:14:35,820
No, no, don't thank me for coming in.
不，不，不要感謝我進來。

328
00:14:36,100 --> 00:14:37,100
At least let me finish.
至少讓我說完。

329
00:14:41,520 --> 00:14:43,440
Uh, we could take the expressway,
呃，我們可以走高速公路，

330
00:14:43,600 --> 00:14:45,220
but, uh, this time of day,
但是，呃，一天中的這個時候，

331
00:14:45,320 --> 00:14:46,840
you're better off taking the budge.
你最好還是接受預算。

332
00:14:50,640 --> 00:14:52,460
You were going for the word bridge there, weren't you?
你本來是要去那裡的單字橋，不是嗎？

333
00:14:54,560 --> 00:14:55,580
I'll have a good day.
我會度過美好的一天。

334
00:15:00,400 --> 00:15:02,660
No, okay, honey, I know you didn't mean to.
不，好吧，親愛的，我知道你不是故意的。

335
00:15:03,360 --> 00:15:04,320
I knew me too.
我也認識我。

336
00:15:04,540 --> 00:15:05,420
Rach, hang up!
瑞琪，結束通話電話！

337
00:15:05,940 --> 00:15:07,080
You're supposed to be taking a guy to the bridge.
你應該帶一個人到橋上。

338
00:15:07,080 --> 00:15:07,940
It's a goddess quiz.
這是一場女神問答。

339
00:15:08,420 --> 00:15:09,800
You know, you should lose like 100 points
你知道，你應該損失100分左右

340
00:15:09,800 --> 00:15:11,660
just for calling your boyfriend in the middle of it.
只是為了在中間打電話給你的男朋友。

341
00:15:13,100 --> 00:15:13,740
Fine, fine.
很好，很好。

342
00:15:17,200 --> 00:15:19,280
Okay, question number 28.
好的，第 28 題。

343
00:15:19,840 --> 00:15:23,080
Have you ever allowed a lightning bearer to take your wind?
你曾經讓閃電攜帶者帶走你的風嗎？

344
00:15:24,280 --> 00:15:25,900
I would have to say no.
我不得不說不。

345
00:15:28,280 --> 00:15:29,920
And I would have to say, pa-ha!
我不得不說，啪哈！

346
00:15:31,660 --> 00:15:32,140
What?
什麼？

347
00:15:32,380 --> 00:15:34,300
Do you not remember the puppet guy?
你不記得那個木偶人了嗎？

348
00:15:34,300 --> 00:15:37,500
Yeah, you like totally let him wash his feet
是的，你完全喜歡讓他洗腳

349
00:15:37,500 --> 00:15:39,660
in the pool of your inner power.
在你內在力量的池子裡。

350
00:15:40,740 --> 00:15:42,080
And his puppet, too.
還有他的傀儡。

351
00:15:43,000 --> 00:15:45,440
Yeah, okay, well, at least I didn't let some guy
是的，好吧，至少我沒有讓某些人

352
00:15:45,440 --> 00:15:48,240
into the forest of my righteous truth on the first date.
第一次約會就進入了我正義真理的森林。

353
00:15:52,680 --> 00:15:53,200
Who?
WHO？

354
00:15:53,460 --> 00:15:53,940
Paul.
保羅.

355
00:15:54,200 --> 00:15:54,660
Oh.
哦。

356
00:15:55,380 --> 00:15:56,740
Okay, okay, okay, okay.
好吧，好吧，好吧，好吧。

357
00:15:56,740 --> 00:15:57,580
Moving on, moving on.
繼續前進，繼續前進。

358
00:15:57,620 --> 00:15:58,120
Next question.
下一個問題。

359
00:15:59,220 --> 00:16:00,260
Okay, number 29.
好的，29 號。

360
00:16:00,940 --> 00:16:02,980
Have you ever betrayed another goddess
你有背叛過別的女神嗎

361
00:16:03,920 --> 00:16:05,960
for a lightning bearer?
對於閃電攜帶者？

362
00:16:05,960 --> 00:16:07,020
Okay, number 30.
好的，30 號。

363
00:16:07,160 --> 00:16:08,000
Whoa, whoa, whoa.
哇，哇，哇。

364
00:16:08,800 --> 00:16:10,000
Let's go back to 29.
讓我們回到29。

365
00:16:12,540 --> 00:16:16,020
Not, uh, not to my recollection.
不，呃，根據我的記憶，不是。

366
00:16:16,320 --> 00:16:20,020
All right, Danny Arshak, ninth grade.
好吧，丹尼·阿爾沙克，九年級。

367
00:16:20,200 --> 00:16:21,360
Oh, come on, Rachel, you know the bottle
哦，來吧，雷切爾，你知道瓶子

368
00:16:21,360 --> 00:16:22,780
was totally pointing at me.
完全是在指著我。

369
00:16:23,000 --> 00:16:25,440
Only because you took up half the circle.
只是因為你佔據了半個圓。

370
00:16:29,260 --> 00:16:30,600
Listen to you two.
聽你們兩個。

371
00:16:30,860 --> 00:16:31,860
It's so sad.
太悲傷了。

372
00:16:33,280 --> 00:16:34,540
Looks like I'm gonna be going
看來我要去

373
00:16:34,540 --> 00:16:35,820
to the goddess meetings alone.
獨自去女神會議。

374
00:16:37,220 --> 00:16:39,520
Well, not when they find out you slept
好吧，不是當他們發現你睡了的時候

375
00:16:39,520 --> 00:16:42,900
with Jason Hurley an hour after he broke up with Monica.
傑森赫利 (Jason Hurley) 與莫妮卡 (Monica) 分手一小時後。

376
00:16:45,180 --> 00:16:46,560
That was only an hour?
那隻是一個小時？

377
00:16:47,120 --> 00:16:49,240
You are such a leaf blower!
你真是個吹葉人！

378
00:16:50,540 --> 00:16:51,620
Pool drainer!
泳池排水器！

379
00:16:51,860 --> 00:16:52,780
Twig snapper!
樹枝鯛魚！

380
00:16:53,140 --> 00:16:54,080
Monkey butt!
猴子屁股！

381
00:16:56,680 --> 00:16:58,120
That is not in the book.
那是書上沒有的。

382
00:16:58,260 --> 00:16:59,980
No, but that's what you are!
不，但你就是這樣！

383
00:17:04,560 --> 00:17:04,960
Oh!
哦！

384
00:17:13,020 --> 00:17:15,340
Oh, hey, uh, be careful with that 3-D Last Supper.
哦，嘿，呃，小心那個 3D 最後的晚餐。

385
00:17:15,580 --> 00:17:16,700
Judas is a little loose.
猶大有點鬆散。

386
00:17:22,360 --> 00:17:23,300
Oh, my God.
我的天啊。

387
00:17:23,540 --> 00:17:24,300
What's going on?
這是怎麼回事？

388
00:17:25,220 --> 00:17:26,780
I've taken all my stuff back.
我已經把我所有的東西都拿回來了。

389
00:17:27,300 --> 00:17:28,320
I guess you were right.
我想你是對的。

390
00:17:28,720 --> 00:17:29,900
No, look, I wasn't right.
不，你看，我錯了。

391
00:17:29,960 --> 00:17:31,200
That's what I came here to tell you.
這就是我來這裡要告訴你的。

392
00:17:32,820 --> 00:17:36,740
I was totally hung up on my own stuff the other day.
前幾天我完全沉迷於自己的事情。

393
00:17:37,160 --> 00:17:38,740
But listen, I'm someone who needs
但聽著，我是一個需要幫助的人

394
00:17:38,740 --> 00:17:40,760
the whole security thing, you know?
整個安全問題，你知道嗎？

395
00:17:40,920 --> 00:17:43,780
To know exactly where my next paycheck is coming from.
確切地知道我的下一份薪水從哪裡來。

396
00:17:43,820 --> 00:17:45,440
But you, you don't need that.
但你，你不需要那個。

397
00:17:45,880 --> 00:17:47,080
And that's amazing to me.
這對我來說太棒了。

398
00:17:47,680 --> 00:17:49,540
I could never do what you do, Joey.
我永遠做不到你所做的事，喬伊。

399
00:17:50,760 --> 00:17:51,540
Thanks, Ross.
謝謝，羅斯。

400
00:17:51,640 --> 00:17:53,620
Yeah, and you should hold out for something bigger.
是的，你應該堅持做更大的事情。

401
00:17:53,740 --> 00:17:55,520
I can't tell you how much respect I have
我無法告訴你我有多少尊重

402
00:17:55,520 --> 00:17:57,720
for you not going to that stupid cab driver audition.
因為你不會去參加那個愚蠢的計程車司機試鏡。

403
00:17:59,000 --> 00:17:59,640
I went.
我去了。

404
00:17:59,740 --> 00:18:00,640
Great! How did it go?
偉大的！進展如何？

405
00:18:01,200 --> 00:18:02,200
I didn't get it.
我沒明白。

406
00:18:02,240 --> 00:18:02,960
Good for you.
對你有好處。

407
00:18:03,080 --> 00:18:03,380
What?
什麼？

408
00:18:03,580 --> 00:18:04,680
You're living the dream.
你正在實現夢想。

409
00:18:04,960 --> 00:18:05,320
Huh?
啊？

410
00:18:06,440 --> 00:18:07,580
All right, then.
好吧，那麼。

411
00:18:09,480 --> 00:18:10,960
Oh, not my parrot.
哦，不是我的鸚鵡。

412
00:18:11,300 --> 00:18:11,520
What?
什麼？

413
00:18:12,140 --> 00:18:13,720
I can't watch this.
我看不了這個。

414
00:18:15,480 --> 00:18:16,660
Hey, hold on, hold on.
嘿嘿，堅持住，堅持住。

415
00:18:17,900 --> 00:18:20,820
How much for the, uh, how much to save the bird?
多少錢，呃，拯救那隻鳥？

416
00:18:22,060 --> 00:18:22,620
$1,200.
1,200 美元。

417
00:18:23,100 --> 00:18:23,580
Dollars?
美元？

418
00:18:23,960 --> 00:18:26,640
You spent $1,200 on a plastic bird?
你花了 1,200 美元買了一隻塑膠鳥？

419
00:18:26,780 --> 00:18:28,400
Uh, it was an impulse buy.
嗯，是一時衝動買的。

420
00:18:28,500 --> 00:18:29,200
It didn't need the register.
它不需要暫存器。

421
00:18:29,960 --> 00:18:31,540
Go ahead, go ahead with the bird.
來吧，跟著鳥兒一起去吧。

422
00:18:32,620 --> 00:18:35,180
It's okay, do you have anything for around $200?
沒關係，你有200美元左右的東西嗎？

423
00:18:35,620 --> 00:18:38,300
Uh, the dog.
呃，狗。

424
00:18:39,180 --> 00:18:39,420
Huh?
啊？

425
00:18:39,740 --> 00:18:40,040
Yeah.
是的。

426
00:18:43,040 --> 00:18:44,000
I'll take it.
我要買它。

427
00:18:44,540 --> 00:18:46,500
My gift to you, man.
我給你的禮物，老兄。

428
00:18:48,740 --> 00:18:49,680
Thanks, Ross.
謝謝，羅斯。

429
00:18:49,880 --> 00:18:49,980
Yeah.
是的。

430
00:18:50,220 --> 00:18:51,520
I really like that bird, though.
不過我真的很喜歡那隻鳥。

431
00:18:52,960 --> 00:18:53,740
But the dog.
但是狗。

432
00:18:54,460 --> 00:18:54,900
Yeah.
是的。

433
00:19:03,860 --> 00:19:04,960
Here are your cakes.
這是你的蛋糕。

434
00:19:05,380 --> 00:19:06,680
We didn't order cake.
我們沒有點蛋糕。

435
00:19:07,580 --> 00:19:08,160
No, I know.
不，我知道。

436
00:19:08,560 --> 00:19:09,480
They're from me.
它們來自我。

437
00:19:10,920 --> 00:19:12,460
Look, you guys, this is not good.
你們看，這可不太好。

438
00:19:13,060 --> 00:19:15,280
I mean, we have enough trouble with guys stealing our wind
我的意思是，我們已經受夠了那些偷我們風的人了

439
00:19:15,280 --> 00:19:16,900
without taking it from each other.
而不從彼此那裡奪走它。

440
00:19:18,620 --> 00:19:19,100
Right.
正確的。

441
00:19:19,300 --> 00:19:22,140
You know, I love you goddesses.
你知道嗎，我愛你們女神。

442
00:19:22,640 --> 00:19:23,640
I love you.
我愛你。

443
00:19:24,760 --> 00:19:26,840
I don't ever want to suck your wind again.
我再也不想吸你的風了。

444
00:19:28,460 --> 00:19:29,140
Thank you.
謝謝。

445
00:19:29,140 --> 00:19:30,340
So are we good?
那我們好嗎？

446
00:19:30,640 --> 00:19:31,320
We're good.
我們很好。

447
00:19:31,400 --> 00:19:31,900
We're good?
我們好嗎？

448
00:19:32,080 --> 00:19:32,340
Yeah.
是的。

449
00:19:32,560 --> 00:19:32,960
Okay.
好的。

450
00:19:33,340 --> 00:19:34,380
Let me take these cakes back,
讓我把這些蛋糕拿回來吧

451
00:19:34,480 --> 00:19:35,720
because they're going to take that out of my paycheck.
因為他們將從我的薪水中扣除。

452
00:19:39,260 --> 00:19:41,220
Ding dong, the psycho's gone.
叮咚，神經病不見了。

453
00:19:45,780 --> 00:19:46,920
Are you sure this time?
這次你確定嗎？

454
00:19:47,120 --> 00:19:49,420
Yes, yes, I actually saw him leave.
是的，是的，我確實看到他離開了。

455
00:19:50,040 --> 00:19:52,420
I mean, that guy is standing in the window holding a human head.
我的意思是，那傢伙站在窗戶裡，手裡拿著一個人頭。

456
00:19:52,980 --> 00:19:55,040
He is standing in the window holding a human head!
他站在視窗，手裡拿著一個人頭！

457
00:19:57,860 --> 00:19:58,740
Check it out, man.
看看吧，夥計。

458
00:19:58,880 --> 00:20:01,320
I tore it off some mannequin in the alley behind Macy's.
我把它從梅西百貨後面小巷裡的一些人體模型上撕下來。

459
00:20:01,800 --> 00:20:03,480
There is no alley behind Macy's.
梅西百貨後面沒有小巷。

460
00:20:03,560 --> 00:20:05,500
So I got it in the junior miss department, big diff.
所以我在初級小姐部門得到了它，差異很大。

461
00:20:06,540 --> 00:20:07,340
Anyway, check it out, man.
無論如何，檢查一下，夥計。

462
00:20:07,380 --> 00:20:08,720
It's going to make a hell of a conversation piece
這將成為一場精彩的談話

463
00:20:08,720 --> 00:20:10,060
at our next cocktail party, huh, pal?
在我們下一次的雞尾酒會上，嗯，朋友？

464
00:20:10,480 --> 00:20:11,880
Our next cocktail party?
我們的下一次雞尾酒會？

465
00:20:12,600 --> 00:20:14,500
Yeah, you know, put chips in it.
是的，你知道，把晶片放進去。

466
00:20:14,540 --> 00:20:16,040
We'll make it like a chip check, you know?
我們會讓它像晶片檢查一樣，你知道嗎？

467
00:20:19,900 --> 00:20:21,680
Eddie, do you remember yesterday?
艾迪，你還記得昨天嗎？

468
00:20:22,420 --> 00:20:24,380
Yes, I think I vaguely recall it.
是的，我想我依稀記得。

469
00:20:29,200 --> 00:20:32,380
Do you remember talking to me yesterday?
你還記得昨天跟我說話嗎？

470
00:20:33,580 --> 00:20:33,980
Yes.
是的。

471
00:20:39,000 --> 00:20:39,940
So what happened?
那麼發生了什麼事？

472
00:20:40,340 --> 00:20:42,280
We took a road trip to Las Vegas, man.
我們去拉斯維加斯公路旅行了，老兄。

473
00:20:42,900 --> 00:20:43,640
Oh, sweet Moses.
噢，可愛的摩西。

474
00:20:45,600 --> 00:20:48,800
So on this road trip, did you guys win any money?
那麼，在這趟公路旅行中，你們贏到錢了嗎？

475
00:20:49,180 --> 00:20:50,140
Nah, I crept out.
不，我偷偷溜了出去。

476
00:20:50,180 --> 00:20:53,220
But Mr. 21 over here, he cleans up 300 bucks.
但是21先生在這裡，他賺了300美元。

477
00:20:53,300 --> 00:20:54,600
Check it out, he buys me these new shoes.
看看吧，他買了這雙新鞋給我。

478
00:20:54,700 --> 00:20:55,160
Sweet, huh?
甜甜的，對吧？

479
00:20:55,160 --> 00:20:55,660
Nice.
好的。

480
00:20:55,940 --> 00:20:56,100
Yeah.
是的。

481
00:20:56,760 --> 00:20:57,500
Well, see you upstairs.
嗯，樓上見。

482
00:20:58,080 --> 00:20:58,520
See you, pals.
再見，朋友們。

483
00:21:02,360 --> 00:21:04,960
Is anyone else starting to really like him?
還有人開始真正喜歡他嗎？

484
00:21:15,820 --> 00:21:16,780
What's happening now?
現在發生什麼事了？

485
00:21:18,800 --> 00:21:19,600
What's happening?
發生什麼事了？

486
00:21:24,820 --> 00:21:26,260
May I help you?
我可以幫你嗎？

487
00:21:27,980 --> 00:21:29,340
Why doesn't my key work,
為什麼我的鑰匙不起作用

488
00:21:29,360 --> 00:21:30,860
and what's all my stuff doing downstairs?
我的東西在樓下做什麼？

489
00:21:31,320 --> 00:21:32,200
I'm sorry.
對不起。

490
00:21:34,020 --> 00:21:35,360
Have we met?
我們見過面嗎？

491
00:21:36,340 --> 00:21:37,740
Hey, Teddy, you freak, your roommate!
嘿，泰迪，你這個怪胎，你的室友！

492
00:21:39,800 --> 00:21:41,620
I'm sorry, I, uh...
對不起，我，呃...

493
00:21:41,620 --> 00:21:43,140
I already have a roommate.
我已經有室友了。

494
00:21:46,240 --> 00:21:46,780
Hello.
你好。

495
00:21:49,980 --> 00:21:52,400
Yeah, he's lived here for years.
是的，他已經在這裡住了很多年了。

496
00:21:52,520 --> 00:21:53,040
I don't...
我不...

497
00:21:53,800 --> 00:21:55,580
I don't know what you're talking about, man.
我不知道你在說什麼，老兄。

498
00:21:55,980 --> 00:21:56,400
Yeah, I know.
是的，我知道。

499
00:21:57,080 --> 00:22:01,480
No, he moved out, and I moved in.
不，他搬走了，我搬進去了。

500
00:22:03,080 --> 00:22:05,640
Well, I think we'd remember something like that.
嗯，我想我們會記住類似的事情。

501
00:22:07,060 --> 00:22:07,760
I know I would.
我知道我會的。

502
00:22:09,740 --> 00:22:11,420
No, that's a good point.
不，這是一個好點。

503
00:22:12,440 --> 00:22:16,360
Okay, well, I guess I got the wrong apartment then.
好吧，我想我當時找錯公寓了。

504
00:22:17,740 --> 00:22:19,180
I'm... I... Look, I'm...
我...我...看，我...

505
00:22:19,180 --> 00:22:20,640
You know, I'm sorry. I'm terribly sorry.
你知道，我很抱歉。我非常抱歉。

506
00:22:20,660 --> 00:22:21,320
Hey, no problem.
嘿，沒問題。

507
00:22:22,000 --> 00:22:22,400
See ya.
再見。

508
00:22:29,340 --> 00:22:31,360
Goodbye, you fruit-drying psychopath.
再見，你這個曬水果的精神病患。

509
00:22:34,240 --> 00:22:35,720
Sir, you want me to help you unpack your stuff?
先生，需要我幫你開啟行李嗎？

510
00:22:35,940 --> 00:22:36,760
Nah, nah, I'm okay.
不，不，我沒事。

511
00:22:37,140 --> 00:22:39,100
Oh, and, uh, just so you know,
哦，還有，呃，讓你知道，

512
00:22:39,660 --> 00:22:41,560
I'm not moving back in because I have to.
我不會搬回去，因為我必須搬回去。

513
00:22:42,220 --> 00:22:43,640
I mean, I do have to.
我的意思是，我確實必須這樣做。

514
00:22:45,080 --> 00:22:48,680
It's just that that place, it wasn't really...
只是那個地方，其實不是…

515
00:22:48,680 --> 00:22:49,640
I mean, this is...
我的意思是，這是...

516
00:22:51,640 --> 00:22:52,920
Welcome home, man.
歡迎回家，夥計。

517
00:23:02,600 --> 00:23:03,740
A little foos?
有點福？

518
00:23:04,040 --> 00:23:04,560
Absolutely.
絕對地。

519
00:23:07,660 --> 00:23:08,880
What happened to the foosball?
桌上足球怎麼了？

520
00:23:09,960 --> 00:23:11,140
Ah, it's a cantaloupe.
啊，這是哈密瓜。

521
00:23:16,940 --> 00:23:19,720
Hey, look, are we gonna have to bring this thing out every time Ross comes over?
嘿，聽著，每次羅斯過來我們都得把這個東西拿出來嗎？

522
00:23:20,040 --> 00:23:21,680
He paid a lot of money for it.
他為此付出了很多錢。

523
00:23:28,300 --> 00:23:29,540
I'm gonna hold him a different way.
我會用不同的方式抱住他。

524
00:23:31,840 --> 00:23:32,800
Look, I don't understand.
看不懂啊

525
00:23:32,920 --> 00:23:35,460
If you hated it so much, why did you buy it in the first place?
如果你這麼討厭它，那你當初為什麼要買它？

526
00:23:35,820 --> 00:23:39,600
Well, I had a whole ceramic zoo thing going over there,
嗯，我在那裡有一個陶瓷動物園的東西，

527
00:23:39,660 --> 00:23:42,360
but now, without the other ones, it just looks tacky.
但現在，沒有了其他的，它看起來就俗氣了。

528
00:23:42,740 --> 00:23:44,740
Yeah, with things like this, more is always better.
是的，對於這樣的事情，越多越好。

529
00:23:47,680 --> 00:23:51,400
So, as you have strangers, you're gonna leave little bathroom tiles all over the place.
所以，當你有陌生人時，你會在浴室各處留下小瓷磚。

530
00:23:52,720 --> 00:23:53,000
Stay.
停留。

531
00:23:55,100 --> 00:23:55,700
Stay!
停留！

532
00:23:56,960 --> 00:23:58,180
Good fake dog.
好假狗。

